## The canonical data flow

I think this is the architecture to freeze:

```text
                         ORACLE
                           │
                    rich Opportunity
                           │
                     select + freeze
                           ▼
                       WorkOrder
                           │
                    AcceptanceContract
                           │
                           ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                       WORKERKIT                         │
│                                                         │
│ start run                                               │
│ record economics                                        │
│ capture evidence                                        │
│                                                         │
│                         │                               │
└─────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────┘
                          ▼
                   ARBITRARY WORKER
             gbrain / Hermes / Pydantic /
             A2A / Claude / future thing
                          │
                          ▼
                       Artifact
                          │
                    independent
                     Verification
                          │
                     CommitGate
                          │
                      Submission
                          │
                  External Outcome
                          │
                     Settlement
                          │
                          ▼
                     WorkReceipt
                          │
             ┌────────────┴────────────┐
             ▼                         ▼
      Worker learning             Moltwork profile
      / economics                 / reputation
```

The most important insight from reviewing all of this is that **WorkerKit's sophistication should move into its evidence model, economics, and accumulated outcome data—not into its agent loop**.

The actual execution surface should become *thinner* as agent harnesses get better.

That gives you a durable product boundary:

> **Bring any agent. WorkerKit turns what it does into economically measurable, independently verifiable work.**

That is the canonical thesis I would now code against.

